# 🎬 Movie Recommendation System

A content-based Movie Recommendation System built using Python, Machine Learning, and Streamlit.

The application recommends 5 similar movies based on the movie selected by the user and displays their posters using the TMDB API.

## 🚀 Features

- Search and select movies
- Get 5 similar movie recommendations
- Display movie posters using the TMDB API
- Interactive Streamlit web interface
- Content-based recommendation using movie similarity

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Streamlit
- TMDB API
- Pickle

## 🧠 How It Works

The recommendation system uses movie features such as genres, keywords, cast, crew, and overview.

These features are processed and converted into vectors. Cosine similarity is then used to calculate similarity between movies.

When a user selects a movie, the system finds the 5 most similar movies and displays their posters using the TMDB API.

